'''Elder Mask Doron''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]] and can be unlocked at a 30% chance when beating [[The Face of God]] (guaranteed if a [[Treasure Radar]] is used). [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] grants Colossus Slayer, Behemoth Slayer, more speed and the knockback ability.

