==Trivia==
*''Doron'' (どろん) is the Japanese onomatopoeia for a person or creature vanishing, such as a ninja concealing themselves with a smoke screen.
*When unmasked, he looks fairly similar to a [[mariowiki:Boo|Boo]] from the ''Mario'' franchise.
*He has the second highest base health of all [[Cat Units]], only beaten by [[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Hades the Deathdealer]].
*The phrase in the Japanese True Form description, "芸術は大爆発" (art is a big explosion), is based on the quote "芸術は爆発だ" (art is an explosion) by the artist [[wikipedia:Tarō Okamoto|Tarō Okamoto]].
*He has the highest negative range of all Cats, with [[Betrothed Balaluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Betrothed Balaluga]] being second and [[Cat God the Great (Special Cat)|Cat God the Great]] being third.

